OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing brother by
OL,4,Astabbing him 36 times
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted fatally stabbing his
OL,7,Fown brother at least 36 times in the
OL,8,Fhead, chest and neck while on bail for
OL,9,Farson.
OL,11,FJack Mitten, 25, was found dead at a
OL,12,Fproperty in Lindum Road in Worthing,
OL,13,FWest Sussex, on 3 September 2025 by his
OL,14,Faunt.
OL,16,FTaylor Mitten, 23, subsequently went on
OL,17,Fthe run from police and shaved his
OL,18,Fbeard in a bid to disguise himself,
OL,19,Fbefore being arrested three days later.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
