OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing brother by
OL,4,Astabbing him 36 times
OL,5,
OL,6,FMitten pleaded guilty to manslaughter
OL,7,Fby diminished responsibility at Lewes
OL,8,FCrown Court in Hove on Friday. He will
OL,9,Fbe sentenced in October.
